<title>FINLAND: N.ALUMINIUM SAYS MORE SHARES OFFERED.</title>
<headline>N.ALUMINIUM SAYS MORE SHARES OFFERED.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish aluminium profiles and components maker Nordic Aluminium Oy said in a statement on Monday that Enskilda Securities, lead manager of its recent share offering, had exercised an option to increase the number of shares on offer by 450,000.</p>
<p>The extra shares were sold to institutional investors at 50 markka each, Nordic Aluminium said.</p>
<p>The initial offering covered 3.0 million shares.  </p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom, +358-9-680 50 240, news@reuters.fi</p>
